    <widget class="QLabel" name="intro">
     <property name="text">
      <string>Your mail is stored encrypted on this computer. The key that opens it is kept in this computer's password store. &lt;b&gt;If that key is lost, your mail can no longer be read.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keep this recovery code somewhere safe, away from this computer (for example printed, or in a password manager). Anyone who has the code can read your mail, so treat it like a password.</string>
